  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Boil the kettle.<br>• Cut zucchini into bite-sized chunks. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69784c2432b868270bf974f1/step-212e4f00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water. <br>• Cook fusilli in the boiling water, over high heat, until ‘al dente’, 11 mins. <br>• Reserve some pasta water (1/4 cup for 2P / 1/2 cup for 4P) then drain and return to pan. Drizzle with a little olive oil to prevent sticking</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69784c2432b868270bf974f1/step-b42e2510.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. <br>• Cook zucchini and mushrooms until browned and softened, 6-8 mins. Add tomato &amp; herb seasoning and cook, until fragrant, 1 min. <br>• Stir in passata, the brown sugar, butter and reserved pasta water. Simmer, until slightly thickened, 2-3 mins. <br>• Remove pan from heat and stir through cooked fusilli and roasted veggies, until combined. Season with salt and pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69784c2432b868270bf974f1/step-d4c87a20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide mushroom and tomato fusilli between bowls. <br>• Sprinkle with Parmesan cheese.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69784c2432b868270bf974f1/step-94ad8f30.jpg"
    }
  ]
